magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19#:~:text=now%20walls%20had%20sprung%20up%20around%20him.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Devouring House\" by Brian Evenson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Nov 2021."}},{"id":"devouring-house-2021-11-19-e4","era":null,"summary":"In a flashback Strefan recalls his first encounter with Brandt decades earlier, when Brandt tore his glamer by shouting that a vampire was in the village.","participants":["strefan-maurer","brandt"],"location":"shadowgrange","importance":"minor","page":"stories/devouring-house-2021-11-19","order":771,"story_date":"2021-11-19","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":28,"quote":"the young man began hollering that there was a vampire in their midst","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19#:~:text=the%20young%20man%20began,vampire%20in%20their%20midst","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Devouring House","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Brian Evenson"],"date":"2021-11-19","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19#:~:text=the%20young%20man%20began,vampire%20in%20their%20midst","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Devouring House\" by Brian Evenson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Nov 2021."}},{"id":"devouring-house-2021-11-19-e5","era":null,"summary":"Brandt's drained body rises and moves toward Strefan, now inhabited by something else.","participants":["brandt","strefan-maurer","hladvora"],"location":"strefan-s-family-manor","importance":"major","page":"stories/devouring-house-2021-11-19","order":771,"story_date":"2021-11-19","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":38,"quote":"the body lurched to its feet","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devou