,"quote":"Hello, darling , the face said.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19#:~:text=Hello%2C%20darling%20%2C%20the%20face%20said.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Devouring House","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Brian Evenson"],"date":"2021-11-19","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19#:~:text=Hello%2C%20darling%20%2C%20the%20face%20said.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Devouring House\" by Brian Evenson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Nov 2021."}},{"id":"devouring-house-2021-11-19-e8","era":null,"summary":"Strefan realizes the Hladvora is feeding on his fear and that the house is his family's ruined manor.","participants":["strefan-maurer","hladvora"],"location":"strefan-s-family-manor","importance":"major","page":"stories/devouring-house-2021-11-19","order":771,"story_date":"2021-11-19","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":80,"quote":"The Hladvora had been feeding on him, drawing on his fear.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19#:~:text=The%20Hladvora%20had%20been,drawing%20on%20his%20fear.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Devouring House","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Brian Evenson"],"date":"2021-11-19","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19#:~:text=The%20Hladvora%20had%20been,drawing%20on%20his%20fear.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Devouring House\" by Brian Evenson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Nov 2021."}},{"id":"devouring-house-2021-11-19-e9","era":null,"summary":"Strefan falls through a floor into his father's deathbed room and sees his fathe