21-11-19#:~:text=Weeping%2C%20with%20all%20his,tore%20his%20father%20open.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Devouring House\" by Brian Evenson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Nov 2021."}},{"id":"devouring-house-2021-11-19-e11","era":null,"summary":"Strefan strangles the creature until it bursts into blood that vanishes into the floor, and the house disappears.","participants":["strefan-maurer","hladvora"],"location":"strefan-s-family-manor","importance":"major","page":"stories/devouring-house-2021-11-19","order":771,"story_date":"2021-11-19","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":117,"quote":"And then suddenly it burst into a torrent of blood within his hands.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19#:~:text=And%20then%20suddenly%20it,blood%20within%20his%20hands.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Devouring House","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Brian Evenson"],"date":"2021-11-19","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19#:~:text=And%20then%20suddenly%20it,blood%20within%20his%20hands.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Devouring House\" by Brian Evenson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Nov 2021."}},{"id":"devouring-house-2021-11-19-e12","era":null,"summary":"Strefan staggers out of the ruin, weak and starving, and fears he might die after all.","participants":["strefan-maurer"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"major","page":"stories/devouring-house-2021-11-19","order":771,"story_date":"2021-11-19","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":122,"quote":"perhaps I won't.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19#:~:text=perhaps%20I%20won%27t.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Devouring House","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Brian Evenson"],"date":"2021-11-19","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/devouring-house-2021-11-19#:~:text=perhaps%20I%20won%27t.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Devouring House\" by Brian Evenson. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 19 Nov 2021."}},{"id":"brandt-e0","era":null,"summary":"Brandt lures Strefan into a pit lined with stakes; Strefan survives, escapes and injures Brandt.","participants":["brandt","strefan-maurer"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"minor","page":"wiki/brandt","order":1321,"story_date":"","storyline":"Innistrad","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":2,"quote":"Brandt managed to lure Strefan Maurer into a pit lined with wooden stakes","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Brandt#:~:text=Brandt%20managed%20to%20lure,lined%20with%20wooden%20stakes","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Brandt","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Brandt","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Brandt#:~:text=Brandt%20managed%20to%20lure,lined%20with%20wooden%20stakes","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Brandt\", section \"History\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}},{"id":"brandt-e1","era":null,"summary":"Brandt's horse collapses and he flees on foot to a nearby ruin.","participants":["brandt","strefan-maurer"],"location":"innistrad","importance":"minor","page":"wiki/brandt","order":1321,"story_date":"","storyline":"Innistrad","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":2,"quote":"his horse eventually collapsed, forcing him to flee on foot to a nearby ruin","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Brandt#:~:text=his%20horse%20eventually%20collapsed%2C,to%20a%20nearby%20ruin","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Brandt","series":"MTG Wiki","autho